% Diet Suggestion System

diet(diabetes, 'Vegetables, whole grains, fruits and low sugar foods').
diet(hypertension, 'Fruits, vegetables, low salt foods and whole grains').
diet(obesity, 'Vegetables, fruits, lean protein and low calorie foods').
diet(anemia, 'Green leafy vegetables, beans, spinach and iron rich foods').
diet(cold, 'Warm soups, fruits, vegetables and plenty of fluids').

% Rule to suggest diet
suggest_diet(Disease, Diet) :-
    diet(Disease, Diet).
